  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHv/749",
  "contentHtml": "<p>&#160;</p><p><b>1. 하와이 마우나케아산 (스바루 망원경 근처) 하늘 (우리나라 보다&#160; 19시간 느림. /&#160; 우리나라가 월요일 낮12시이면,&#160; 일요일 저녁 5시, )</b></p><p>오후 3시 수업이라면, 저녁 8시하늘이라 운이 좋으면, 실시간 밤하늘을 수업시간에 아이들과 함께 볼 수 있겠네요.</p><p>두번째 링크는 마우나케아산의 보이는 실시간 별자리 입니다.&#160;</p><p>오렌지색 레이저가 보인다면 적응광학을 위한 인공 별 역할을 하는 레이저라고 합니다.</p><p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/eH90mZnmgD4\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/eH90mZnmgD4</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eH90mZnmgD4\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"868\" data-video-height=\"488\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/jMtUp/hyQsbcAPaf/L37FdDnQHjQsiPI3Czi8ok/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"868\" data-video-origin-height=\"488\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/eH90mZnmgD4\" width=\"868\" height=\"488\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/fPgVSTj7TZc\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">마우나케아산 보이는 별자리 https://youtu.be/fPgVSTj7TZc</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fPgVSTj7TZc\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"854\" data-video-height=\"480\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bDcul7/hyQwyRwer7/lqCjXrkkdcK778d5vYvgm0/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"854\" data-video-origin-height=\"480\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/fPgVSTj7TZc\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p><b>2 일본 나가노 기소마치 천문대 하늘 (우리나라 시각과 같음)</b></p><p><b>저녁 천체 관측 캠프 등을 할때 우리나라 기상이 않좋다면, 일본 하늘 이라도...ㅎ</b></p><p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/SDRS6JQulmI\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/SDRS6JQulmI</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SDRS6JQulmI\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"868\" data-video-height=\"488\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cmxEhk/hyQtptxy74/ipBVxZr61FP0OMjsFp9cs1/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"868\" data-video-origin-height=\"488\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/SDRS6JQulmI\" width=\"868\" height=\"488\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>기소마치 천문대 하늘의 실시간 별자리를 보여줍니다.</p><p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/Qbt3BVjC9Wg\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/Qbt3BVjC9Wg</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qbt3BVjC9Wg\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"868\" data-video-height=\"488\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bMRZh1/hyQtt3MJBh/1jaLFlIfjUryGWJ14ONgRk/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"868\" data-video-origin-height=\"488\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Qbt3BVjC9Wg\" width=\"868\" height=\"488\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p><b>3. ISS(국제우주정거장)이 찍은 실시간 지구 모습&#160; 2가지- 지평선 각도 카메라, 지표면방향 카메라</b></p><p>우연히 우리 상공을 지난다면 수업 시간에 보여 주기 좋을 것 같습니다.!!^^ 우주정거장이 밤지역을 지날 때는 카메라가 꺼집니다.TT..</p><p><br>1)지평선 각도 카메라 (ISS)</p><p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/ddZu_1Z3BAc\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/ddZu_1Z3BAc</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ddZu_1Z3BAc\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"868\" data-video-height=\"488\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/c64cGO/hyQr54xJop/WdhBgFWxCHMelGkornLA9k/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"868\" data-video-origin-height=\"488\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ddZu_1Z3BAc\" width=\"868\" height=\"488\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2980ec1ba153b8e0434031a5f55be98f2422e78b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2980ec1ba153b8e0434031a5f55be98f2422e78b\" data-origin-width=\"1270\" data-origin-height=\"826\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>2)지표면 방향 카메라 (ISS)</p><p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/6m8nImSX2bs\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/6m8nImSX2bs</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6m8nImSX2bs\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"868\" data-video-height=\"488\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/b7MkrK/hyQscP8Ibo/jAKMG89mjpDahex907lT40/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"868\" data-video-origin-height=\"488\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/6m8nImSX2bs\" width=\"868\" height=\"488\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3550bffe506e06d944e91c0f10fcbf8b827b9789\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3550bffe506e06d944e91c0f10fcbf8b827b9789\" data-origin-width=\"1265\" data-origin-height=\"770\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&lt;라이브 스트림 모음&gt;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\"><span>하와이 마우나 케아(Mounakea Hawaii)&#160; </span><a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://youtu.be/eH90mZnmgD4\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/eH90mZnmgD4</a> </span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\"><span>나가노 기소 천문대 근처(Kiso LiveCam)&#160; </span><a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://youtu.be/SDRS6JQulmI\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/SDRS6JQulmI</a> </span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\"><span>동경 <span style=\"color: #202124; background-color: #ffffff;\">쓰키지 시장</span>&#160;(TsukijiShijo, Tokyo&#160; </span><a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://youtu.be/nI6LEDNu-_c\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/nI6LEDNu-_c</a> </span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\"><span>동경 신궁 외원(JinguGaien, Tokyo) </span><a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Bn1hf3kZdS4\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/Bn1hf3kZdS4</a> </span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\"><span>후쿠시마 (Fukushima) </span><a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ylSiGa_U1UE\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/ylSiGa_U1UE</a> </span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\"><span>마루가메, 카가와 (Marugame, Kagawa) </span><a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Vcae5KnDip8\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/Vcae5KnDip8</a></span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">ISS 지표면 방향 카메라&#160;<a href=\"https://youtu.be/6m8nImSX2bs\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/6m8nImSX2bs</a></span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">ISS 지평선 각도 카메라 <a href=\"https://youtu.be/ddZu_1Z3BAc\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/ddZu_1Z3BAc</a></span></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
